'''Princess Kaguya''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] event or the [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] increases her health, attack power, range and chance to slow to 100%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]] is an improved version of her Normal Form with increased health and the [[Metal Killer]] ability.

